	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Tacui sane ita, ut dicis,<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Anspielung auf <ref target="file12950">Nr. 2901</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17167-1" type="qv"/>.</note> observande frater, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>sed quid in tanta diversitate nedum rum<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>orum sed literarum, earum etiam, quae scribuntur <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ab hominibus fide dignis, scribas certi?<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Anspielung auf <ref target="file12960">Nr. 2911</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17177-3" type="qv"/>.</note></s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Malui <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ergo tacere quam cum mendatio coniunctum dicere tantillum.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Boni ergo consulas meum silentium.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Dicitur sa<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>ne caesar<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note> bellum ex <persName ref="p18477">Germania</persName> translaturus in <placeName ref="l862">Hel<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>vetiam</placeName>,<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Vgl. dazu die in <ref target="file12969">Nr. 2920</ref>, <ptr target="qvfn17185-2" type="qv"/>, angegebenen Stellen.</note> qua de re adeo non dubito, ut, si non <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>fecerit, quod facturus dicitur, nihil ei nisi commodam <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>occasionem deesse putem.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Quodsi <ptr target="fna" type="footnote" n="a"/>aliquid ei<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>Am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> obstiterit, de<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>dit nobis dominus<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>Über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note> haud dubie tempus ad poenitentiam.<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>2Petr 3, 9</ref></cit>.</note></s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Iam <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>quidem dicitur fuisse in consultatione, quomodo potuerit <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>obsidione premere <placeName ref="l257">Constantiam</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Sed evenit in <placeName ref="l808">Belgico</placeName><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Hier im Sinne von Norddeutschland!</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>quod minime speravit, unde mutatum arbitror <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>consilium.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">In <placeName ref="l808">Belgico</placeName> caesa est caesaris legio <lb xml:id="p1z16"/><placeName ref="l808">Belgica</placeName>.<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Das <placeName ref="l20">niederländische</placeName> Heer des kaiserlichen Feldhauptmanns <persName ref="p7364">Martin von Rossem</persName>; s. dazu <ref target="file12931">Nr. 2882</ref> und <ptr target="qvfn17149-2" type="qv"/>.<ptr target="zfnfn17202-2" type="zfn"/></note></s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Primum enim urbes maritimae exercitum duci<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>s <ptr target="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"/><persName ref="p18716">Erychi</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Der auf kaiserlicher Seite stehende <persName ref="p18716">Erich II. d.J. von Braunschweig-Calenberg</persName>. - Zu der hier angesprochenen Niederlage der Kaiserlichen bei <placeName ref="l2418">Drakenburg</placeName> am 23. Mai s. <ref target="file12960">Nr. 2911</ref>, <ptr target="qvfn17177-1" type="qv"/>.</note>, ex fratre nepotis<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>Am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> <persName ref="p20318">Heinrychi Brunsvicensis</persName> capti<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="9">Der kaiserliche <persName ref="p20318">Herzog Heinrich d.J. von Braunschweig-Wolfenbüttel</persName>, der seit dem 21. Oktober 1545 vom protestantischen Landgrafen <persName ref="p3590">Philipp von Hessen</persName> gefangen gehalten wurde. - Die von <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> angegebene Verwandtschaft stimmt allerdings nicht: Der Vater von <persName ref="p18716">Erich II.</persName>, Herzog <persName ref="p20612">Erich I. von Braunschweig-Lüneburg</persName> (1470-1540), war nicht der Bruder des gefangenen <persName ref="p20318">Heinrich d.J</persName>., sondern der Bruder vom Vater des Letzteren, <persName ref="p18770">Heinrich I. von Braunschweig-Wolfenbüttel</persName> (1463-1514).<ptr target="zfnfn17202-4" type="zfn"/></note>, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>non procul a <placeName ref="l61">Brema</placeName> ceciderunt.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Ubi vero <placeName ref="l749">Saxoni<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>cę</placeName> urbes et reliquiae electoris<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10"><persName ref="p19065">Johann Friedrich I. von Sachsen</persName>. - Mit <hi>reliquiae</hi> sind die noch ungeschlagenen Truppen des Kurfürsten gemeint; s. dazu die Mitteilung von <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> in <ref target="file12960">Nr. 2911</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17177-4" type="qv"/>.</note> suas quoque copias <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>iunxissent maritimis<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Mit den oben schon erwähnten protestantischen Truppen der <placeName ref="l2655">Hansestädte</placeName>.</note>, reliquum quoque ex-<pb type="edition" next="260"/>ercitum,<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">Gemeint ist erneut das oben bei <ptr target="qvfn17202-2" type="qv"/> erwähnte kaiserliche Heer unter <persName ref="p7364">Martin von Rossem</persName>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z21"/><placeName ref="l61">Bremam</placeName> adhuc obsidentem sub <persName ref="p7364">Martino Roß<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>heimio</persName>, fugarunt et clade affecerunt.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p18396">Duns<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>hyrnius</persName> vero <placeName ref="l749">Saxo</placeName><note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Der <placeName ref="l749">sächsische</placeName> Oberst <persName ref="p18396">Wilhelm von Thumshirn</persName>, der an der Schlacht bei <placeName ref="l2418">Drakenburg</placeName> teilgenommen hatte; s. <ref target="file12967">Nr. 2918</ref>, <ptr target="qvfn17184-4" type="qv"/>.</note> intercepit illos, quos caesar <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>subsidium <placeName ref="l61">Bremam</placeName> obsidentibus miserat, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>electissimos equites 1500, peditum 16 vexilla, et <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>omnes prope extinxit.<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Vgl. <ref target="file12976">Nr. 2927</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17194-3" type="qv"/>.</note></s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p18538">Caesar</persName> ubi intellexit, quod <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>infeliciter sui pugnassent, relicto <placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgo</placeName>,<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">Vgl. <ref target="file12978">Nr. 2929</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17196-1" type="qv"/>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>quod <placeName ref="l558">Wittenberga</placeName> discedens obsedit,<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16">Der Kaiser hatte <placeName ref="l303">Magdeburg</placeName> nicht belagert, sondern sich damals vergeblich bemüht, die Stadt zur Unterwerfung aufzufordern. Schließlich verhängte er am 27. Juli 1547 die Acht über sie; s. Friedrich <hi>Hülße,</hi> Die Stadt Magdeburg im Kampfe für den Protestantismus während der Jahre 1547-1551, Halle a. d. Saale 1892, S. 20f (mit dem falschen Datum vom 26. Juli); und die in <bibl source="https://gateway-bayern.de/VD16+D+843">VD16 D843</bibl>f angeführten Drucke zu dieser Angelegenheit.<ptr target="zfnfn17202-3" type="zfn"/></note> <placeName ref="l1430">Halam <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Saxonum</placeName><note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17"><placeName ref="l1430">Halle (Saale)</placeName>; s. <ref target="file12978">Nr. 2929</ref>, <ptr target="qvfn17196-2" type="qv"/>. - Zur Abfassungszeit des vorliegenden Briefes hatte der Kaiser <placeName ref="l1430">Halle</placeName> bereits verlassen (s. <bibl source="b610">Stälin</bibl> 580) und war der Landgraf am 19. Juni schon verhaftet worden (s. <ref target="file12997">Nr. 2948</ref>, <ptr target="qvfn17213-1" type="qv"/>). All dies aber wusste <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> noch nicht.</note> contendit.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Nam <placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgum</placeName> festinarunt <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>omnes nostrorum cunei.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Fortassis <placeName ref="l1430">Halam</placeName> usque <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>caesarem persequentur, praesertim cum <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinandus</persName><note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="18">König <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinand I.</persName>, Bruder <persName ref="p18538">Karls V.</persName> - Vgl. <ref target="file12978">Nr. 2929</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17196-3" type="qv"/>.</note> fratre <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>relicto contendat in <placeName ref="l2449">Bohemiam</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Haec omnia multi<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>s scribuntur ad me pro verissimis.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Additur totam <lb xml:id="p1z34"/><placeName ref="l994">Neapolim</placeName> esse in armis contra <persName ref="p18285">caesaris vicarium</persName><note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" n="19"><persName ref="p18285">Pedro Álvarez de Toledo</persName>. - Zur Angelegenheit s. zuletzt <ref target="file12964">Nr. 2915</ref>; <ref target="file12978">Nr. 2929</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17196-2" type="qv"/>.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>qui voluerit instituere et exercere <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>inquisitionem <placeName ref="l875">Hispanam</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/>Dum igitur arbi<lb xml:id="p1z38"/>tramur rem esse conclamatam, alicubi, et ubi mini<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>me putaveramus, excitat dominus auxilium.<note xml:id="fn20" type="footnote" n="20">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Klgl 3, 18-26. 54-58</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Ez 37, 11-14</ref></cit>.</note></s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Fidamus <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>ergo illi, qui potest nos eripere e malis <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>omnibus.<note xml:id="fn21" type="footnote" n="21"><cit type="bible"><ref>Ps 121 (Vulg. 120), 7</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 6, 13</ref></cit>.</note></s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Faciamus nos nostrum officium <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>omnes adhor<lb xml:id="p1z43"/>tantes ad poenitentiam et fidem.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Quod si perrexerint <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>homines in vita impia, et v<lb xml:id="p1z45"/>enerit i<lb xml:id="p1z46"/>udicium dei: Vae impio!<note xml:id="fn22" type="footnote" n="22"><cit type="bible"><ref>Jes 3, 11</ref></cit>.</note></s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Bene vero<pb type="scan" next="v."/> <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>rursus pio!</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Novit dominus Loth ex incendio liberare,<note xml:id="fn23" type="footnote" n="23"><cit type="bible"><ref>Gen 19, 1-29</ref></cit>.</note> <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>impios autem et huius et futuri seculi igni<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>bus terrere.<note xml:id="fn24" type="footnote" n="24"><cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 3, 12 par.</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Apk 14, 11</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>20, 10.</ref></cit></note></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div6" corresp="regest6">
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Audio <placeName ref="l21">Badenae</placeName> hactenus non male <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>convenire <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiis</placeName>.<note xml:id="fn25" type="footnote" n="25">Die in <placeName ref="l21">Baden</placeName> am 20. Juni begonnene und damals noch nicht beendete eidgenössische Tagsatzung; s. <ref target="file12982">Nr. 2933</ref>, <ptr target="qvfn17201-1" type="qv"/>.<ptr target="zfnfn17202-1" type="zfn"/></note></s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Sed ubi certiora habuero, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>communicabo.<note xml:id="fn26" type="footnote" n="26">Vgl. <ref target="file12994">Nr. 2945</ref>, <ptr target="qvfn17217-8" type="qv"/>.</note></s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Ex nostris legati sunt d. <persName ref="p1888">Lava<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>terus</persName> et <persName ref="p6793">Dumysius</persName>.<note xml:id="fn27" type="footnote" n="27">Dass <persName ref="p1888">Hans Rudolf Lavater</persName> und <persName ref="p6793">Itelhans Thumysen</persName> an der Tagsatzung waren, ergibt sich auch aus <bibl source="b197">EA</bibl> IV/1d 824.</note><pb type="edition" next="261"/></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div7" corresp="regest7">
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Oremus dominum sedulo, ut <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>adsit nobis.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale aeternum cum omnibus fratribus.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/>Salutabis d. <persName ref="p1278">Gastium</persName>, a quo scire desidero, num acceperit pecunias <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>per <persName ref="p505">Burckherum</persName><note xml:id="fn28" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="28"><persName ref="p505">John Burcher</persName>, wie aus <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Brief an diesen vom 28. Juni 1549 (<placeName ref="l491">Straßburg</placeName> BNU, Ms 679, Thesaurus Baumianus XX, Nr. 101) zu entnehmen ist, wo am Schluss <hi>Vale mi Burckere</hi> zu lesen ist. - Anlass für die Geldüberweisung an <persName ref="p1278">Gast</persName> war die von diesem für <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Gattin, <persName ref="p8051">Anna, geb. Adlischwyler</persName>, besorgte Wolle; s. zuletzt s. <ref target="file12972">Nr. 2923</ref> vom 3. Juni.</note> missas.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutabis d. <persName ref="p8032">Dryandrum</persName><note xml:id="fn29" type="footnote" n="29"><persName ref="p8032">Francisco de Enzinas</persName>.</note> et omnes amicos.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>29. iunii anno 1547.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse darunter:]</note>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la">Praestantissimo viro d. <persName ref="p8418">Osvaldo Myc<lb xml:id="p2z11"/>onio</persName>, <placeName ref="l28">Basiliensis</placeName> eclesiae ministro primo, domino suo observan<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>do et fratri dilectissimo.</s>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>